# Gemini Live API key — get one at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Copy this file to `.env` (or `.env.local`) and paste your key below.
# NOTE: With Vite, any VITE_* var is bundled into the client build and is
# visible in the browser. This is fine for LOCAL development only.
# For production, mint short-lived ephemeral tokens from a backend instead.
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
